Remember that with the unix version you need to define the directory in
two places: the HACKDIR macro in include/config.h and GAMEDIR in the top
Makefile. You changed HACKDIR but forgot to change the Makefile, right?

And while editing the Makefile, you might want to delete or comment out
the -rm -rf $(GAMEDIR) $(VARDIR) command in the install target..
I usually also rename the "install" target to "newinstall" so I don't
accidentally make it when I want to make update.

